    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Explore <strong>Twilight Palms Mall,</strong>\u00a0a pure-blooded American retail paradise! Frequented by happy customers, cannibals, spiritual beings, and our lovely mall staff.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>proximity voice chat</strong>, <strong>physics based movement</strong> and <strong>up to 5 other friends</strong>, complete your shift as a member of the <strong>Night Crew</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Oh god. It Knows.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are being hunted.</strong> Run or hide from nocturnal monstrosities that track with you not only with sight, but sound and smell too. That pie you pinched from the bakery, may mean you end up in the next batch.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Job</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Management have a couple of boxes they want ticking.</strong> Luckily, they have several <span class=\"bb_strike\">suckers</span>\u00a0\ud835\ude9d\ud835\ude8a\ud835\ude95\ud835\ude8e\ud835\ude97\ud835\ude9d\ud835\ude8e\ud835\ude8d \ud835\ude8a\ud835\ude9c\ud835\ude9c\ud835\ude8e\ud835\ude9d\ud835\ude9c to sort them out. Fix cabling, clean up trash, \ud800\udf04\ud800\udec4\ua74a\ud800\udf10\ud800\udf02\ud800\udf09\ud800\udf14\ud800\udf04 \ud800\udf14\ua74a\ud800\udf0c\ud800\udf04 \ud800\udf14\ud800\udf13\ud800\udf09\ud800\udf10\ud800\udf09\ud800\udf15\ud800\udf14... Whatever it takes to keep the suits happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > And If you or one of your companions meets an unfortunate end... well... someone will have to clean up that mess...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Many ways to die.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Served in soup. Neck snapped. Lost in madness. Crew members are exposed to a myriad of horrifying entities in the faint glow of neon light. Maybe it's time to break out that torch, and a can of bear spray.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shareholder Satisfaction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep management happy and your head above water - or you may lose it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The executives want one thing: year on year growth. Just keep the freaks under the rug.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\ud835\ude7d\ud835\ude98\ud835\ude9d\ud835\ude91\ud835\ude92\ud835\ude97\ud835\ude90 \ud835\ude92\ud835\ude9c \ud835\ude9c\ud835\ude99\ud835\ude98\ud835\ude98\ud835\ude94\ud835\ude92\ud835\ude8e\ud835\ude9b \ud835\ude9d\ud835\ude91\ud835\ude8a\ud835\ude97 \ud835\ude8a \ud835\ude8d\ud835\ude92\ud835\ude99 \ud835\ude92\ud835\ude97 \ud835\ude9c\ud835\ude91\ud835\ude8a\ud835\ude9b\ud835\ude8e \ud835\ude99\ud835\ude9b\ud835\ude92\ud835\ude8c\ud835\ude8e\ud835\ude9c!</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Crew</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick your unique crew member</strong>, each with <strong>powerful and upgradable traits</strong> that allow you to make a huge impact. <strong>Each misfit plays differently</strong>, and different combinations will give you endless ways to complete your tasks!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here's what you can experience already:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc7b 10 unique enemies</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">\ud835\ude90\ud835\ude9b\ud835\ude8e\ud835\ude8a\ud835\ude9d \ud835\ude93\ud835\ude98\ud835\ude8b \ud835\ude9c\ud835\ude8a\ud835\ude9d\ud835\ude92\ud835\ude9c\ud835\ude8f\ud835\ude8a\ud835\ude8c\ud835\ude9d\ud835\ude92\ud835\ude98\ud835\ude97</span></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f 6 iconic crew members</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">\ud835\udea0\ud835\ude98\ud835\ude97\ud835\ude8d\ud835\ude8e\ud835\ude9b\ud835\ude8f\ud835\ude9e\ud835\ude95 \ud835\ude8c\ud835\ude98-\ud835\udea0\ud835\ude98\ud835\ude9b\ud835\ude94\ud835\ude8e\ud835\ude9b\ud835\ude9c</span></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2b06\ufe0f 50+ upgrades</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">\ud835\ude91\ud835\ude8e\ud835\ude8a\ud835\ude95\ud835\ude9d\ud835\ude91\ud835\udea2 \ud835\udea0\ud835\ude98\ud835\ude9b\ud835\ude94-\ud835\ude95\ud835\ude92\ud835\ude8f\ud835\ude8e \ud835\ude8b\ud835\ude8a\ud835\ude95\ud835\ude8a\ud835\ude97\ud835\ude8c\ud835\ude8e</span></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u231a 20+ tasks</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">\ud835\ude92\ud835\ude97\ud835\ude8d\ud835\ude9e\ud835\ude9c\ud835\ude9d\ud835\ude9b\ud835\udea2 \ud835\ude9c\ud835\ude9d\ud835\ude8a\ud835\ude97\ud835\ude8d\ud835\ude8a\ud835\ude9b\ud835\ude8d \ud835\ude8c\ud835\ude98\ud835\ude96\ud835\ude99\ud835\ude8e\ud835\ude97\ud835\ude9c\ud835\ude8a\ud835\ude9d\ud835\ude92\ud835\ude98\ud835\ude97</span></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What's not to love?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re adding a tonne more content, remember to join our Discord for the latest news!</p>",
